CORE
template-indirect.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites --cvc5
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Dynamic sites: 2 resolved, 0 unreachable, 0 unresolved \(3 rounds\)$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* "value=\$\{kopt_"\*"\}": SUCCESS$
^\[shell-unsupported\.1\] .* the parts of the text of eval for the holes of "value=\$\{kopt_"\*"\}" have no character .*: FAILURE$
^\[assertion\.1\] .* = /dev/sda1: SUCCESS$
^\[shell-unsupported\.2\] .* the parts of the text of eval for the holes of \*"=on" have no character .*: SUCCESS$
^\[assertion\.2\] .* = on: SUCCESS$
^\[shell-unsupported\.3\] .* the name of the assignment to \* is of a variable of the script .*: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Holes in the names of variables: the expansion and the assignment
dispatch over the script's variables whose names match. The name from
the second argument may be anything, which is reported at line 5.
